    "Shared host; pinned affinity does not isolate cores or control clocks/scheduler/thermal effects.",
    "Task observations are aggregate ns/operation; timeline observations are per-fixture p50/p95/p99 over 200 samples after 16 warmups. They are not interchangeable.",
